      "message": "In the original filter implementation, there was an explicit call to `ImageToColorSpace` that was lost in the first refactor, in which case we\u0027d re-evaluate CFs or colorspaces. Adding kSampledRepeatedly brings it back to the original behavior on avoiding that logic but allows matrix transforms through w/o a temporary image still.",
